msgid "<0>Wikidata</0> city coordinates — CC0."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/SourcesPage.tsx:1127
msgid "<0>YouTube restream:</0> the inbound ingest and the outbound destination publishing (Routing) are separate paths — one failing never means the other is broken."
